  "description": "A ridiculous broadcast where they randomly assault weak students, “Loner Hunt.” \n\nHee-Jun, who enjoyed watching “Loner Hunt,” loses the person he cares most about to “Loner Hunt.” Furious, he teams up with his childhood friend and starts making a broadcast to fight against bullies...! \n\n“Loner Hunt” is a refreshing revenge of bullies who burst their moon balloons!\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
